-info><text:p>The supplier keeps title to the goods until they are paid in full.</text:p><text:p/></text:deletion></text:changed-region><text:changed-region xml:id="ct25" text:id="ct25"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Carla Duarte</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T02:55:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p><text:s/>of</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region><text:changed-region xml:id="ct26" text:id="ct26"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Bo Chen</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T03:02:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p><text:s/>the</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region><text:changed-region xml:id="ct27" text:id="ct27"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Bo Chen</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T03:09:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p><text:s/>party</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region><text:changed-region xml:id="ct28" text:id="ct28"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T03:16:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p><text:s/>for</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region><text:changed-region xml:id="ct29" text:id="ct29"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Dev Patel</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T03:23:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p><text:s/>control</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region><text:changed-region xml:id="ct30" text:id="ct30"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Bo Chen</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T03:30:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p><text:s/>from</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region></text:tracked-changes>
   <text:h text:outline-level="1">Heavy on deletions</text:h>
   <text:p>The supplier may subcontract only<text:change text:change-id="ct1"/> the buyer's prior consent.</text:p>
   <text:p><text:change text:change-id="ct4"/><text:span text:style-name="B">Payment</text:span> is due<text:change text:change-id="ct5"/> receipt of a correct invoice.</text:p>
   <text:p>Late payments<text:change text:change-id="ct6"/> interest at the statutory rate.</text:p>
   <text:p>Disputes go first to mediation and then to the courts of Manhattan.</text:p>
   <text:p>The <text:span text:style-name="I">buyer</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="B">may</text:span> inspect the goods before accepting them.</text:p>
   <text:p><text:change text:change-id="ct7"/><text:change text:change-id="ct8"/><text:s/>may subcontract <text:span text:style-name="B">only</text:span> with the buyer's prior<text:change text:change-id="ct9"/>.</text:p>
   <text:p><text:change text:change-id="ct10"/><text:s/>payments carry interest<text:change text:change-id="ct11"/><text:change text:change-id="ct12"/> statutory<text:change text:change-id="ct13"/>.<text:change text:change-id="ct14"/> The price includes<text:change text:change-id="ct15"/> but <text:span text:style-name="B">excludes</text:span> shipping and taxes.</text:p>
   <text:p>Either party<text:change text:change-id="ct16"/><text:change text:change-id="ct17"/><text:change text:change-id="ct18"/> agreement with<text:change text:change-id="ct19"/> days written notice.</text:p>
   <text:p><text:change text:change-id="ct24"/>The supplier shall deliver the goods within thirty days<text:change text:change-id="ct25"/><text:change text:change-id="ct26"/> order.</text:p>
   <text:p>Neither<text:change text:change-id="ct27"/> is liable<text:change text:change-id="ct28"/> <text:span text:style-name="I">delays</text:span> caused by events beyond its<text:change text:change-id="ct29"/>.</text:p>
   <text:p>The <text:span text:style-name="I">warranty</text:span> period is twelve months<text:change text:change-id="ct30"/> delivery.</text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
